                <!-- Section 1: Code of Conduct -->
                <div id="conductSection" class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
                        <span id="txt-tag-conduct" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Community Standards</span>
                        <h2 id="txt-doc-conduct-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2">Note by Note Code of Conduct</h2>
                    </div>

                    <p id="txt-doc-conduct-intro">Our platform connects passionate music mentors with dedicated learners to foster artistic growth, technical skill, and creative collaboration. To build an inspiring, inclusive, and safe community, all members must adhere to these guidelines.</p>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-sec1-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-pink-500"></i> Inclusive &amp; Respectful Community
                        </h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                            <li id="txt-sec1-p1"><strong class="text-slate-800">Zero Tolerance for Discrimination:</strong> Prohibits harassment, bigotry, or discrimination based on race, ethnicity, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, or musical background.</li>
                            <li id="txt-sec1-p2"><strong class="text-slate-800">Constructive Feedback:</strong> Critique must focus constructively on music and performance. Personal attacks or disparaging comments are forbidden.</li>
                            <li id="txt-sec1-p3"><strong class="text-slate-800">Respect Diversity:</strong> Honor diverse musical genres, traditions, and skill levels without bias.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-sec2-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-check text-brand-600"></i> 2. Professional Boundaries &amp; Safety
                        </h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                            <li id="txt-sec2-p1"><strong class="text-slate-800">Maintain Professional Relationships:</strong> All communications must stay focused on music, education, and artistic growth.</li>
                            <li id="txt-sec2-p2"><strong class="text-slate-800">Punctuality &amp; Reliability:</strong> Honor scheduled mentorship appointments and respect fellow musicians' time.</li>
                            <li id="txt-sec2-p3"><strong class="text-slate-800">Platform Communication:</strong> Keep all video sessions, lesson scheduling, and chats within our encrypted platform interface for personal security.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-sec3-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-copyright text-amber-500"></i> 3. Intellectual Property &amp; Confidentiality
                        </h3>
                        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                            <li id="txt-sec3-p1"><strong class="text-slate-800">Confidential Creative Work:</strong> Unreleased lyrics, audio tracks, and stems shared during mentorship sessions remain the sole property of the creator. Recording sessions without mutual consent is prohibited.</li>
                            <li id="txt-sec3-p2"><strong class="text-slate-800">No Plagiarism:</strong> Always respect copyright laws and properly attribute shared work.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-900 flex items-start gap-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat text-amber-600 text-lg mt-0.5"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong id="txt-minor-title" class="font-semibold block">Minor Safety Policy (Under 18)</strong>
                            <span id="txt-minor-desc">Sessions involving minors require explicit parental/guardian consent. All video recordings for minor sessions are archived for safety verification purposes.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Section 2: Terms of Service -->
                <div id="termsSection" class="hidden space-y-6">
                    <div class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
                        <span id="txt-tag-terms" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Legal Terms</span>
                        <h2 id="txt-doc-terms-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2">Terms of Service &amp; Mentorship Agreement</h2>
                    </div>

                    <p id="txt-doc-terms-intro" class="text-sm">By accessing or using the Note by Note platform, you agree to be bound by these legal terms and conditions.</p>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-tos1-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">1. Booking and Cancellation Policy</h3>
                        <p id="txt-tos1-desc" class="text-sm text-slate-600">Sessions may be canceled or rescheduled up to 24 hours prior to the scheduled start time without penalty. Late cancellations or missed sessions may forfeit session credits.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-tos2-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">2. Mentorship Fees &amp; Payments</h3>
                        <p id="txt-tos2-desc" class="text-sm text-slate-600">All fees are processed through secure payment gateways on Note by Note. Direct payments between mentors and mentees outside the platform are strictly prohibited.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-tos3-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">3. Account Termination</h3>
                        <p id="txt-tos3-desc" class="text-sm text-slate-600">Note by Note reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate our Code of Conduct or compromise platform safety.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

